<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51143" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīsum</span></b> , i, n.
		video, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>something seen</i>, !*? <i>sight</i>, <i>appearance</i>, <i>vision.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">visa somniorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 1, 41, 97</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">talia visa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 26</span></i>
			 (3, 21), 20: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dic age ... visa quid ista ferant,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 3, 5, 32</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">turpia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 6, 28</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., a transl. of the Gr. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαντασία</span>, <i>an impression made by some
				external object upon the senses</i>, <i>an
			image</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Ac. 1, 11, 40</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">2, 6, 18</span></i>; <i><span class="en">2, 24, 77</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
